            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Considerable differences in tenderness are observed during the diagnostic testing of dental sensitivity (so-called vitality tests). Tenderness of the teeth varies during the course of the day; differences in the amount of tenderness correlated with the thickness of the layer of dental enamel.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
